body:
We currently don't use type hints in the class reference:

```suggestion
				var gravity = Input.get_gravity()
				var roll = atan2(-gravity.x, -gravity.y)
				gravity = gravity.rotated(-Vector3.FORWARD, roll)
				var pitch = atan2(gravity.z, -gravity.y)
				var magnet = Input.get_magnetometer().rotated(-Vector3.FORWARD, roll).rotated(Vector3.RIGHT, pitch)
				var yaw = atan2(-magnet.x, magnet.z)
```

This may change in the future, but for now, we should be consistent with the existing docs.
